---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "@/components/ui/Container.astro";
import Button from "@/components/ui/Button.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="What Worm Studio is, and how we work — an SEO, GEO & AEO agency done properly, never automated."
  path="/about"
>
  <Container grid class="pt-20 pb-24">
    <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-8">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold text-ink leading-tight">
        A UK search visibility agency, built to be found — everywhere search happens.
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 mt-8">
      <p class="text-lg text-ink-muted">
        Worm Studio exists because search stopped being just Google.
        People ask AI tools like ChatGPT for recommendations now, and most
        businesses have no idea whether they even show up there. We help
        brands get found in both — properly written, properly structured
        content, not templated shortcuts stuffed for an algorithm.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg text-ink-muted mt-6">
        SEO, GEO, and AEO aren't three separate services here — they're
        one connected system. The technical work (schema, structure,
        crawlability) and the writing work both matter, and neither one
        works well without the other.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg text-ink-muted mt-6">
        Worm Studio is run by Daniel Glazebrook — a full-stack web
        developer with a design background and over a decade in SEO. The
        studio is new; the expertise behind it isn't.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <Button href="/daniel-glazebrook" variant="outline">Meet the founder</Button>
        <Button href="/#approach" variant="text">Read our approach</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>
